 13).\n- If Anne is round then Anne is kind (from point 14).\n- If Anne is smart and Anne is quiet then Anne is not round (from point 15).\n- All blue things are round (from point 16).\n- If something is kind and not round then it is young (from point 17).\n\nGiven these conditions, we can conclude that Harry is not rough because:\n- He is not blue (point 8).\n- He is not kind (point 9).\n- He is not round (point 13).\n- He is not quiet (point 10).\n- He is not young (point 10).\n</answer>",
